 {id:12,by:'nbd',t:'2h',m:'text',title:'Naira watch: what to check before you convert savings this week',body:'Exchange rates can move quickly. Before you convert, compare at least three licensed sources, check the date on every quote, and never pay into an unknown account for a better rate. Keep a receipt for every transaction.',up:1800,down:40,bm:900,com:420,eh:8},
