 {id:3,by:'og',t:'8h',m:'text',title:'Three offline deals I flipped in Lagos this week',body:'Bought three bulk items below market price from traders on the Island and resold them in smaller lots. Margins ran from 18 to 30 percent. The key is to confirm demand before you pay anyone.',up:540,down:21,bm:200,com:214,eh:9.5},
 {id:19,by:'nbd',t:'4h',m:'text',title:'Reminder: no genuine opportunity asks you to pay to get a job',body:'Recruiters do not charge for interviews, training slots or placement. If someone asks for money before you start, walk away and report the account. Always confirm vacancies on the official website of the company.',up:2400,down:30,bm:1500,com:610,eh:15},
 {id:14,by:'schol',t:'5h',m:'text',title:'Scholarship season: the documents to prepare before applications open',body:'International scholarship portals reward early, complete applications. Prepare your transcripts, passport, two referees, a one-page statement and your language test results. Check eligibility on the official site only.',up:1100,down:18,bm:640,com:190,eh:18},
