 {id:4,by:'ogu',t:'9h',m:'text',title:'How I earn dollars from Port Harcourt',body:'I sell design retainers to overseas clients on a monthly basis. I price in dollars, collect through a domiciliary account and always keep two clients on standby.',up:800,down:40,bm:330,com:340,eh:14},
