 {id:5,by:'glord',t:'11h',m:'text',title:'The premium skill stack paying seven figures',body:'These are the four skills that keep showing up in high-ticket deals this year. Learn them in a fixed order and ignore everything else until the first one pays you.',hidden:'Order to learn: 1. Sales calls. 2. Offer design. 3. Short-form video. 4. Paid ads. Start with a 14-day sales script drill, then book five practice calls.',price:500,ltype:'Guide',proof:'Followed this order myself and closed my first high-ticket client in a month.',up:410,down:12,bm:288,com:512,eh:2.6},
 {id:20,by:'aza',t:'12h',m:'text',title:'Passport and visa timelines: plan around the slow months',body:'Processing times change through the year. Book appointments early, keep digital copies of every document and only use official booking portals. Anyone promising a guaranteed visa slot is not to be trusted.',up:340,down:7,bm:210,com:120,eh:22},
 {id:18,by:'chioma',t:'12h',m:'text',title:'Thrift reselling: what sells fastest around Lagos campuses',body:'Denim jackets, plain tees and bags move fastest at the start of a semester. Photograph in daylight, post on Monday evening and price with a small margin for bargaining.',up:95,down:3,bm:44,com:31,eh:9},
